The desktop application bundles MapLibre GL JS 6.0.0 for offline interactive
maps. MapLibre GL JS is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. Its license is
included at public/vendor/maplibre/LICENSE.txt.

The preferred VisionEval Workbench runtime image is built from the official
VisionEval VE-40-RC7 source release at commit
7852dc58fad460ff279f5eebf4dd55fe191470ad. VisionEval is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Its upstream license and source history are
preserved in the runtime image.

VE-40-RC7 contains the official complete-household-ID alignment correction.
The 1.1 runtime applies no unofficial VisionEval source patch. The Workbench
container image is not an official VisionEval distribution and does not imply
endorsement by VisionEval. The prior RC6 Workbench image remains supported as
a separately identified rollback runtime.

The bundled PlanRVA MM example contains public regional planning model inputs.
Those data are distinct from the VisionEval software and are provided as-is,
without warranty. See resources/examples/planrva-mm/NOTICE.md.
